    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meridian Hotel &amp; Spa stays dark all season.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re here to <strong>keep things clean</strong>. Your tasks are simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Sweep the floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Throw out the trash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Put things back where they belong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One room at a time. One hallway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun doesn\u2019t rise here. But at least you get to see the Northern Lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something feels off, don\u2019t stop working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last shift ended early. Management won\u2019t say why.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Meridian Hotel &amp; Spa stays dark all season.<strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re here to <strong>keep things clean</strong>. Your tasks are simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Sweep the floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Throw out the trash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Put things back where they belong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One room at a time. One hallway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun doesn\u2019t rise here. But at least you get to see the Northern Lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something feels off, don\u2019t stop working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last shift ended early. Management won\u2019t say why.</p>",
